title: "When an agent says \"done\": 143 completion claims checked by an independent verifier"
abstract: "An anonymized dataset of 533 task runs (May to October 2026) by AI agents and deterministic runners, in which every structured completion claim was checked by a separate, rule-based verifier, with a short report, a failure taxonomy and a reproduction script."
type: dataset
